<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A12.SS3" title="In Appendix L Direct Measurement of Distributional Stability (Definition 3.1) ‣ Stability of In-Context Learning: A Spectral Coverage Perspective" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">L.3 </span>Alignment with knee-points and spectral proxy</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A12.SS4" title="In Appendix L Direct Measurement of Distributional Stability (Definition 3.1) ‣ Stability of In-Context Learning: A Spectral Coverage Perspective" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">L.4 </span>Stability probability and divergence quantiles</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A12.SS5" title="In Appendix L Direct Measurement of Distributional Stability (Definition 3.1) ‣ Stability of In-Context Learning: A Spectral Coverage Perspective" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">L.5 </span>Discussion: consistency and boundary cases</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></nav>
